  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "Gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch Addressables system. T\u1EA1i sao d\xF9ng thay Resources.Load?"
  choices:
  - text: "Addressables ph\u1EE9c t\u1EA1p, t\xF4i v\u1EABn d\xF9ng Resources.Load
      cho \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Ch\u01B0a bi\u1EBFt v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 c\u1EE7a Resources.Load
      trong production."
  - text: "Addressables cho ph\xE9p load asset theo \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 (key)
      thay v\xEC path c\u1EE9ng. \u01AFu \u0111i\u1EC3m: async loading kh\xF4ng block
      main thread, remote asset loading t\u1EEB CDN, memory management t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n
      (release khi kh\xF4ng d\xF9ng), bundle asset hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3 h\u01A1n Resources
      folder. Resources.Load \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 v\xE0 kh\xF3 optimize."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "N\u1EAFm r\xF5 async, remote loading v\xE0 memory management."
  - text: "Addressables cho ph\xE9p load asset t\u1EEB internet v\xE0 qu\u1EA3n l\xFD
      memory t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n. Resources.Load load \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 n\xEAn
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 lag."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u 2 \u0111i\u1EC3m ch\xEDnh nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EA7y
      \u0111\u1EE7."
  category: Unity
